t.md","line":238},{"title":"Channel Management reports","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":240},{"title":"Create a single score report","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/c_SingleScoreCharts.md","line":252},{"title":"Create a reference field interactive filter","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/t_CreateAReferenceFieldPublisher.md","line":268},{"title":"sn\\_channel\\_mgmt.kpi\\_auto\\_refresh.interval.seconds","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":277},{"title":"property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":294},{"title":"system property","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":294},{"title":"Reports for Agents in Channel Management","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":306},{"title":"Create a single score report","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/c_SingleScoreCharts.md","line":318},{"title":"Create a reference field interactive filter","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/now-intelligence/t_CreateAReferenceFieldPublisher.md","line":334},{"title":"Track and analyze agents' performance","target":"use-channels-configurable-wfo-cs","line":345},{"title":"Database views","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/c_DatabaseViews.md","line":357},{"title":"add the Reports related list","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/platform-administration/configure-form-layout.md","line":369},{"title":"points","target":"gamification-components-points","line":433},{"title":"Track and analyze agents' performance","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/customer-service-management/use-channels-configurable-wfo-cs.md","line":466},{"title":"Components installed with Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"components-installed-configurable-wfo-cs","line":565},{"title":"Optimize workforce operations","target":"setup-configurable-wfo-cs","line":566},{"title":"Using Channel Management in Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"use-channels-configurable-wfo-cs","line":567},{"title":"Workforce Optimization for Customer Service","target":"configurable-wfo-cs","line":568},{"title":"Lists","target":"migration-lists","line":569},{"title":"Rules","target":"gamification-components-rules","line":570},{"title":"Points","target":"gamification-components-points","line":571}],"metadata":{"title":"Setting up service channels and queues","description":"You can set up service channels, queues, and key performance indicators \\(KPIs\\) to route work items automatically to agents based on an agent's availability, capacity, and skills.Add service channels and queues to automatically route incoming work items to agents.Define agent assignment rules and specify groups of agents who are eligible to receive overflow work assignments for a queue.Configure key performance indicators \\(KPIs\\) in service channels to your teams to track the ongoing work and real-time performance of teams.Configure key performance indicators \\(KPIs\\) for queues so that you can track the incoming work by category in a service channel.Configure key performance indicators \\(KPIs\\) in service channels for your agents so that you can track the agents' ongoing work and real-time performance.Configure supervisor lists in a service channel to view the list of active work items across service channels and queues.Use scripted extension points to configure the sort order for the columns in the All Agents and All Queues lists for Channel Management.Use scripted extension points to configure the columns in the All agents list for Channel Management.Use scripted extension points to configure the columns in the All queues list for Channel Management.Generate and distribute a daily scheduled report that summarizes the agent's work performance via email.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/customer-service-management/setup-channels-queues-configurable-wfo-cs.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":15,"breadcrumb":["Optimize workforce operations","Extend capabilities","Configure","Customer Service Management"],"tags":["#customer-service-management","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/customer-service-management/setup-channels-queues-configurable-wfo-cs.md"},
